WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.500
A chatbot answers. An agent does — it books the meeting,
queries the database, sends the email.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:18.200
A plain model only predicts the next word. It's brilliant at language,
but it can't touch your calendar, your database, or your email.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:33.500
An agent runs a loop: reason, act, observe, repeat. It thinks about
what to do, calls a tool, reads the result — until the goal is done.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.200
Real power, real risk. On anything that matters it pauses for human
approval and acts only after you say yes — every step logged.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.200
That's an agent. Learn to build it at Sage Academy — or have it built for you.
